    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d453-a1">

                <pb facs="0814" n="714" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg714"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in 1073 — Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ruelas to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-10-13"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 13,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the note of your legation
                    dated the 3d of last June, and complying with the desire expressed by said
                    legation, I have the honor to remit to you copies of an extract of the principal
                    proceedings in the case instituted against Zeferino Avalos for the crime of
                    homicide, as well as of the sentence of execution which was pronounced in the
                    case.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>M. RUELAS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
